# ROVEXO Single Source of Truth Master Lock

**STATUS: GLOBAL | MANDATORY | ENTIRE PLATFORM**

## Core policy

**Everything must exist only once.**

**One feature = One implementation = One source of truth.**

## Forbidden

- Duplicate pages
- Duplicate components
- Duplicate routes
- Duplicate features
- Duplicate database logic
- Duplicate API logic
- Duplicate states
- Duplicate UI implementations

## Examples

**Allowed:** One Homepage · One Profile · One Settings · One Wallet · One Checkout · One Search · One Design System · One Shipping Engine · One Payment Engine

**Forbidden:** `*_V2` · `*_NEW` · `*_BACKUP` · `*_BETA` · `OLD_*` · unused / legacy parallel components

## Cursor must never

- Create duplicate files
- Create temporary features
- Create unused components / routes / states
- Create unused database structures

## When improving a feature

**IMPROVE → SIMPLIFY → REUSE → PRESERVE**

Never: Copy → Paste → Duplicate → Rebuild

## Reuse rule

If an existing component can be reused, **it must be reused**.

## Zero Duplication Policy

One feature = One source of truth.

**Owner approval required.**
